Proof/regression test for the siglog cmod (lifetime change history of HAL
signals).  filestream replays mixed-type samples onto sig.* signals; siglog
logs them with include=/exclude= filtering, and siglog-decode prints the
header and the changes.  Exercises: the snapshot at the first RT call (signals
netted after `load`), the all-signals first frame, change detection per type
(including float -0.0 compared by bits), filtering and its no-match warning,
and the END record written on unload.
